// correlation-id-completeness.kql
// Description: Confirms every span in the last hour carries a non-empty correlation.id custom
// dimension and that operation_Id/operation_ParentId/id are well-formed (32/16/16 hex chars
// respectively, per docs/telemetry/mapping/identity-correlation-fields.md, #89). Flags any span
// missing correlation.id as a completeness defect, not a silent gap.
// Expected output shape: a single summary row [totalSpans, missingCorrelationId, malformedTraceId,
// malformedSpanId]. Healthy result: all three "malformed"/"missing" counts are 0.
AppDependencies
| where timestamp > ago(1h)
| extend correlationId = tostring(customDimensions["correlation.id"])
| extend traceIdValid = (strlen(operation_Id) == 32)
| extend spanIdValid = (strlen(id) == 16)
| summarize
    totalSpans = count(),
    missingCorrelationId = countif(isempty(correlationId)),
    malformedTraceId = countif(not(traceIdValid)),
    malformedSpanId = countif(not(spanIdValid))
